@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@batchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Root status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Submit a valid batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientCode": "KAYA",
  "fileName": "KAYA_20261018_001.txt",
  "expectedRecordCount": 1,
  "records": [
    {
      "recordId": "R0001",
      "cardholderName": "T MOKOENA",
      "maskedPan": "************4821",
      "productCode": "DEBIT_GOLD",
      "expiry": "09/29"
    }
  ]
}

### List batches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/batches?clientCode=KAYA&status=Accepted&page=1&pageSize=20

### Get a batch by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/batches/{{batchId}}

### Release a batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/batches/{{batchId}}/release